historical_heights = "Let H614 and H620 be the recorded done heights of v6.1.4 and v6.2.0: tracing selects frozen v614 for H614 <= h < H620 (or until the next applied version). All frozen snapshots retain their original behavior, including malformed-key panics. The active body retains the old boundary while v7.0 has not been applied or h is below its recorded done height Hmerge; scheduling alone does not activate the repair. It refuses invalid decoded key lengths at h >= Hmerge after application. No network-specific Hmerge is invented."
baseline = "No baseline gate was run: the task's explicit ordered qualification instructions forbid verification before implementation and prohibit running verify_cmd by hand. No pre-change test failure is claimed."
wiring = "None: use the existing common.MergePlanActive and staking.GetVersioned paths without modifying another domain."
evidence = "The private hf-build/hf-done ledger records the candidate revision, exact commands, exit codes and log paths; the final response copies its last evidence line."
continuation = "Attempt 3 retains the standalone real-keeper proof after 22.31.463 repaired the external CLI callers. Track the validator-key-length guard now published by 22.33.1201; assert its full error including the decoded length. No frozen implementation is modified."

